We can try to apply it for the simples case, when $\\mathbf{f}_{n} = - m\\mathbf{x}/|\\mathbf{x}|^4$ is sort of a gravity force caused by a red star in the center

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
estimateX[n_Integer, initialV_:0.01] := FixedPoint[Function[x,
  {
    2 x[[1]] - x[[2]] - 0.001 (*FB[*)((x[[1]])(*,*)/(*,*)((*SpB[*)Power[Norm[x[[1]]](*|*),(*|*)4](*]SpB*)))(*]FB*), 
    x[[1]], 
    x[[2]]
  }
], {
  {-1.0, 2 initialV 0.01},
  {-1.0, initialV 0.01},
  {-1.0, 0}
}, n];

