%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Great! At least it did not collapse 🙂 It would be great to see it live. For this we apply the same strategy with `Offload` technique

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Module[{bridgeState, lines, points, handler},

  handler = Function[Null, 
    bridgeState = processVertices[bridgeState, {1,2,19,20}, bonds];
    lines = MapThread[{bridgeState[[1,#1]], bridgeState[[1,#2]]}&, bonds // Transpose];
  ];

  bridgeState = {bridge, bridge, bridge};
  lines = MapThread[{bridgeState[[1,#1]], bridgeState[[1,#2]]}&, bonds // Transpose];
  points = bridge;

  Show[plotBridge[bridge], Graphics[{
    ColorData[97][1], Point[points // Offload],
    Line[lines // Offload],
    EventHandler[AnimationFrameListener[lines // Offload], handler]
  }]]
]

